# Long-press boundary at Steam Long Press Time = 450ms (East button_b: F10 tap / F11 hold)
# expect: <450ms => F10 on release (interruptable=on suppresses F10 if F11 fires)
# expect: >=450ms => F11 only (F10 suppressed by interruptable)
# probing 430, 450, 470ms press durations

# 430ms => tap => F10 on release
press EAST 430
wait 800

# 450ms => at-boundary — probing whether hold fires or tap fires
press EAST 450
wait 800

# 470ms => hold => F11 only (F10 suppressed)
press EAST 470
wait 800
